-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",335,{
[10689]="700718A0\n1\tSearch for missing scholars\tOrthél has asked you to find a group of scholars who went to study the blight outside of Sul Madásh and have yet to return.\n2\tInspect scholar\tYou found scholars who have fallen to the blight. See if they have the notes Orthél mentioned to confirm they are the ones who went missing.\n3\tReturn to Orthél with the scholars' notes\tReturn to Orthél in Sul Madásh with the notes recovered from the missing scholars and inform her of their fates.\n",
[10690]="7004E1E4\n1\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. King Thorin III has received word that Vethúg Wintermind draws near to Erebor. When you are prepared, you should speak to the King under the Mountain.\n2\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found before his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have triumphed over Vethúg Wintermind, but at great cost. You should speak to King Thorin III.\n",
[10691]="70071618\n1\tTalk to Unusâli\tUnusâli and Sorkamâl will be travelling to the Dawn-warden with you to meet with the Aradûni. You should talk to Unusâli.\n2\tFind Unusâli, Sorkamâl, and Hidâti\tUnusâli, Sorkamâl, and Hidâti have gone ahead. You should meet them near Ushumût, the Grave of Serpents.\n3\tDefeat the mirages\tYou are being attacked by fell mirages, seemingly caused by Ishími, the Anguished Wind. You should defeat the mirages!\n4\tContinue to the Dawn-warden\tUnusâli, Sorkamâl, and Hidâti have gone ahead to the Dawn-warden. You should continue west and find the Dawn-warden.\n5\tTalk to Captain Hanâbu\tIt seems that Ishími, the Anguished Wind haunts the Dawn-warden. You should find the Aradûni officer in charge of the camp.\n",
[10692]="7006BF8D\n1\tTravel to Dul Râkh\tNâmi has asked you to travel to the cave in Dul Râkh and thin the number of scorpions in the area.\n2\tDefeat scorpions in Dul Râkh cave (total: 10)\tDefeat scorpions inside the cave at Dul Râkh for Nâmi at the Dumûri camp in Urash Dâr.\n3\tReturn to Nâmi\tReturn to Nâmi in Urash Dâr and let her know you have thinned the number of scorpions in Dul Râkh.\n",
[10693]="70009EC1\n1\tDefeat the Free Peoples at Tol Ascarnen (total: 10)\tSlaughter the Free Peoples in and around Tol Ascarnen to earn the favour of your masters. Quartermaster Apsduf told you to prepare for battle against the Free Peoples and to do your part to repel them from Tol Ascarnen.\n2\tTalk to Quartermaster Apsduf\030Talk to War-tyrant Akúlhun\tIf Apsduf is slain or Tol Ascarnen was taken by the enemy, go to War-Tyrant Akúlhun at Gramsfoot. You have successfully slaughtered the Free Peoples and should return to Apsduf to claim your reward.\n",
[10694]="700169CF\n1\tDefeat Dulgurz\tDulgurz is at Athmadhul, south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Ótam told you of a particulary dangerous Warg-rider, Dulgurz, who must no longer be allowed to roam the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Ótam at Mekhem-bizru\tÓtam is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of Athmadhul. Ótam will want to hear of the defeat of Dulgurz.\n",
[10695]="70071B48\n1\tTBD Return to quest giver\tTBD Return to Quest Bestower\n",
[10696]="70015E19\n1\tScour the company's path\tThe camp-site is nestled at the base of some large boulders, some distance to the south-east of Gwingris, beyond Sâd Rechu, south of the road to Pembar. Maedlathron has asked you to search a place which may have been a camp-site used by the Company. Any signs of the Company's passing must be removed.\n2\tTalk to Maedlathron at Gwingris\tMaedlathron is at Gwingris, some distance to the north-west of the abandoned camp-site. You should bring the pouch of pipe-weed which you found to Maedlathron.\n",
[10697]="7002149C\n1\tScout the first patrol point\tThe first patrol point is north-east of Echad Idhrenfair. Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.\n2\tScout the second patrol point\tThe second patrol point is north-west of the first. Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.\n3\tScout the third patrol point\tThe third patrol point is south-west of the second. Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.\n4\tScout the fourth patrol point\tThe fourth patrol point is south of the third. Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.\n5\tScout the fifth patrol point\tThe fifth patrol point is east of the fourth. Idhrenfair has asked you to patrol the paths of the Gloomglens with instructions to keep an eye out for any signs of the Enemy's minions.\n6\tTalk to Idhrenfair at Echad Idhrenfair\tIdhrenfair is at Echad Idhrenfair in the Gloomglens of Enedwaith, north-west of the fifth patrol point. You should return to Idhrenfair with news of your discoveries.\n",
[10698]="70062AA6\n1\tLook from the hilltop south-east of Howlingstones\030Find the hill south-east of Howlingstones mentioned by Eleri\tEleri asked you to look out into the distance from the hill south-east of Howlingstones, east of Mossward.\n2\tTalk to Eleri on the eastern side of Mossward\tEleri is on the eastern side of Mossward, within view of the gate.\n",
[10699]="700217A9\n1\tScout the western entrance of Gwâl Draig\030Scout the southern entrance of Gwâl Draig\030Scout the eastern entrance of Gwâl Draig\030Defeat Draig-lûth guards (total: 8)\tGwâl Draig lies on the southern shore of the river, north-east of Gronu's camp. Gronu has asked you to scout out the entrances to the camp and dispatch any guards you might encounter.\n2\tTalk to Gronu at his camp\tGronu is at his camp south-east of Gwâl Draig. You should seek out Gronu and let him know what lies within the village of Gwâl Draig.\n",
[10700]="70062AA4\n1\tLook at the gates of Tharbad for the mark of the White Hand\030Find the gates of Tharbad, north-west of Mossward\tEleri asked you to look for the mark of the White Hand at the gates of Tharbad, north-west of Mossward. She was very insistent that you avoid battle if the foes there seem too dangerous.\n2\tTalk to Eleri on the eastern side of Mossward\tEleri is on the eastern side of Mossward, in view of the gate.\n",
[10701]="70062AA2\n1\tLook into the distance at the intersection of the track that leaves Mossward's north gate and the Old South Road\030Find the intersection of the track that leaves the north gate of Mossward and the Old South Road\tEleri asked you to look into the distance at the intersection of the Old South Road with the track that leaves Mossward from the north gate of the village.\n2\tTalk to Eleri on the eastern side of Mossward\tEleri is on the east side of town, in view of the gate.\n",
[10702]="70048C4E\n1\tScout the first location\030Scout the second location\030Scout the third location\030Scout the fourth location\030Scout the fifth location\tFaeron and Rhadrog have asked for your help scouting the southern wilds of Agarnaith. You should scout locations on the southern edge of the swamp.\n2\tComplete: Flora Collection\030Complete: Fauna Collection\tFaeron and Rhadrog have asked for your help scouting the southern wilds of Agarnaith. You should complete Rhadrog's tasks in southern Agarnaith.\n3\tMeet up with Faeron and Rhadrog near the Ranger Camp\tFaeron and Rhadrog should now be returning to the Agarnaith Ranger Camp. You should meet up with Faeron and Rhadrog.\n4\tMeet up with Faeron and Rhadrog near the Ranger Camp\tFaeron and Rhadrog should now be returning to the Agarnaith Ranger Camp. You should meet up with Faeron and Rhadrog.\n5\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron can be found at the Agarnaith Ranger Camp. You should talk to Faeron and deliver your scouting report.\n",
[10703]="7001E994\n1\tScout the western camp-fire\030Scout the path to Ânug-stazg\030Scout the eastern camp-fire\tÂnug-stazg can be found east and slightly north of Mithechad. Perindúr has asked you to scout out the path leading into Ânug-stazg and the camp-fires at the edges of the camp.\n2\tTalk to Perindúr at Mithechad\tPerindúr is at Mithechad, west and slightly south of Ânug-stazg. You should return to Perindúr with your report of the Enemy's forces at Ânug-stazg.\n",
[10704]="7001500F\n1\tFind Wigfast, the scout at Gazatmur\tThe goblin encampment lies below the Dolven-view at Gazatmur. Good vantage points for scouting can be found to the north and south of the encampment. Slagvi has asked you to scout a large goblin encampment. He warned you to avoid being seen.\n",
[10705]="700266A2\n1\tLook around for signs of activity\030Find the ruins of Arthobel\tArthobel is south-west of the Ranger-encampment in the Way of Kings. Maladan asked you to scout the ruins of Arthobel to see if the tomb-robbers are actively using it.\n2\tTalk to Maladan\tMaladan is at the Ranger-camp in the Way of Kings. Maladan will be pleased to hear the tomb-robbers have not gained access to Arthobel.\n",
[10706]="70066EA7\n1\tScout the south-west gate\030Scout the south-east gate\tTorthril has asked you to scout the Pahor Boha's entrances. Pahor Boha can be found in the south-east of Pinnath Gelin.\n2\tTalk to Torthril\tYou to have scouted Pahor Boha's defences and should report your success. Talk to Torthril in Ost Arndír.\n",
[10707]="70054038\n1\tThranduil has asked you to scout Parth Daenath.\t\n2\tTalk to Thranduil\tThranduil can be found at Echad-in-Edhil. You should talk to Thranduil.\n",
[10708]="7002C650\n1\tScout the northern Oathbreaker camp\tMedwine is camped outside the Oathbreaker camp in northern Parth Celebrant. Idmar has advised you to seek out Medwine.\n2\tTalk to Medwine\tMedwine is camped outside the Oathbreaker camp in northern Parth Celebrant. Idmar has advised you to seek out Medwine.\n3\tScout the Oathbreaker camp to the east of Idmar's encampment\030Scout the Oathbreaker camp to the west of Idmar's encampment\tOathbreakers have appeared across Parth Celebrant. Medwine has told you to scout the camps to the east and west of Idmar's encampment to understand the force they face.\n4\tTalk to Idmar\tIdmar is at his camp along the road in central Parth Celebrant. You should return to Idmar with news of your discoveries.\n",
[10709]="7004E913\n1\tYou should patrol look-out spots in Skarháld.\t\n2\tReturn to Agátur\tYou should return to Agátur in Skarháld and tell him of the drake attacks.\n",
[10710]="7000E839\n1\tScout Echad Candelleth\tEchad Candelleth lies in Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to begin your patrol at the camp of Echad Candelleth.\n2\tScout Echad Gauradan\tEchad Gauradan lies in Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to scout the encampment of Echad Gauradan.\n3\tScout the Forgotten Monument\tThe Forgotten Monument lies in the eastern area of Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to scout the overlook marked by the Forgotten Monument. It provides a commanding view of the surrounding lands.\n4\tScout Echad Candelleth\tEchad Candelleth lies in Tâl Bruinen, south of the Trollshaws, far to the south and east of the North Downs. Handarod has asked you to complete your patrol by returning to Echad Candelleth.\n5\tTalk to Handarod\tHandarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs, far to the west and north of Tâl Bruinen. You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen in the wilds of Tâl Bruinen.\n",
[10711]="7000E834\n1\tScout Weatherfoot\tWeatherfoot lies far to the east of Bree-land, near Weathertop in the Lone-lands. Nidgyl has asked you to scout the Orc-encampment at Weatherfoot.\n2\tScout Glumhallow\tGlumhallow is far to the east of Bree-land, near Weathertop in the Lone-lands. Nidgyl has asked you to scout the Orc-encampment at Glumhallow.\n3\tScout Echad Sûl\tEchad Sûl is a small hill that lies north of Weathertop in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land. Nidgyl has asked you to scout the ruins of Echad Sûl.\n4\tScout Weathertop\tWeathertop is in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree-land. Nidgyl has asked you to climb Weathertop itself to examine the surrounding lands.\n5\tTalk to Nidgyl\tNidgyl is at Bree-town in Bree-land, far to the west of Weathertop. You should report to Nidgyl and tell them what you have seen from the heights of Weathertop.\n",
[10712]="7005843A\n1\tScout the lower camp\030Scout the east portion of the camp\030Scout the southern section of the camp\030Examine the back of the camp\tZarkul-sulûn is in southern Elderslade. Laugi has asked you to scout Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Gunvald\tGunvald is in Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. You have enough information to make a report to Gunvald.\n",
[10713]="7001D0D7\n1\tPatrol the first point in northern Gathbúrz\030Patrol the second point in northern Gathbúrz\030Patrol the third point in northern Gathbúrz\030Patrol the fourth point in northern Gathbúrz\tThe first point is north-east of Thangúlhad. The second point is to the north-west of the first, direcdly north of Kúfuzg. The third point is directly north of Thangúlhad, a little south of Búrzkala. The fourth point is just north-west of Thangúlhad. You should scout the waypoints of the patrol that Handelen has asked you to undertake and defeat any enemies you might find there.\n2\tTalk to Handelen at Thangúlhad\tHandelen is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should return to Handelen with the report of your patrol.\n",
[10714]="70047CF1\n1\tScout the Northern Noman-lands\030Scout the Southern Noman-lands\030Scout the Dead Marshes\tFind three survey locations around the Noman-lands. Legolas has asked you to scout areas in the Noman-lands and destroy any blighted wildlife you find.\n2\tComplete Quest 'Culling the Blighted'\030Complete Quest 'Creatures of the Mire'\tComplete two quests for Legolas while exploring the Noman-lands. Legolas has asked you to scout areas in the Noman-lands and destroy any blighted wildlife you find.\n3\tReturn to Legolas\tLegolas can be found at the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should return to Legolas.\n",
[10715]="700544AC\n1\tFind Búrzangh, the Shrouded Forge\030Find Dâr Grazadh, the Hall of Rot\030Find the Song-house of Lindalírë\030Scout the western side of the Circle of Sorrow\030Scout the north-eastern side of the Circle of Sorrow\030Scout the north-western side of the Circle of Sorrow\tDamrod has asked you to scout the Circle of Sorrow in Minas Morgul.\n2\tTalk to Damrod in Barad Orhant\tDamrod can be found in Barad Orhant in Minas Morgul. You should talk to Damrod.\n",
[10716]="70043DF3\n1\tPatrol the broken bridge to the Dome of Stars\030Patrol the central lookout\030Patrol atop the Archives\030Patrol the southern pier\030Patrol the central pier\030Patrol the Court of Anárion\tYou should patrol the Western side of Osgiliath.\n2\tSpeak with Cangoras\tCangoras is at the Palace of Eldacar. You should speak to Cangoras.\n",
[10717]="7005A460\n1\tInvestigate Kamaz-kala\030Investigate Dursh Hûl\030Investigate Cloudyhead Pass\030Investigate Muru Azog\030Investigate Rung-shakam\tLocations to be scouted can throughout Azanulbizar. Sárgo Stiffbeard has asked you to take over the duties of the scouts that you rescued.\n2\tTalk to Sárgo\tSárgo is in Zirakazhâr. You should return to Sárgo.\n",
[10718]="7003783D\n1\tScout the first Orc-camp\030Scout the second Orc-camp\030Scout the third Orc-camp\tOrc-camps lie to the north-west and south of Aldburg. Arcil would like you to assess the threat posed to the Eastfold by scouting the nearby Orc-camps.\n2\tTalk to Arcil\tArcil is in the Mead Hall of Aldburg. You scouted the Orc-camps and now have a better idea of their number. You should return to Aldburg and convey this information to Arcil.\n",
[10719]="7003A67E\n1\tScout the first Orc-camp\030Scout the second Orc-camp\030Scout the third Orc-camp\tOrc-camps lie to the north-west and south of Aldburg. Éothain would like you to assess the threat posed to the Eastfold by scouting the nearby Orc-camps.\n2\tTalk to Éothain\tÉothain is located near the entrance of Aldburg. You scouted the Orc-camps and now have a better idea of their number. You should return to Aldburg and convey this information to Éothain.\n",
[10720]="7004305A\n1\tInvestigate the entrance\030Investigate the piers\030Inspect the northern structure\030Investigate the Rammas Echor wall\030Complete Quest, The Harlond: Fell Tools\030Complete Quest, The Harlond: Cruel Eyes\030Complete Quest, The Harlond: Black Hearts\tThe Orc forces are camped in the Harlond, on the northern edge of Lossarnach and south of the Rammas Echor. Dindal the scout has encouraged you to go into the Harlond and survey the Orc forces to learn what can be done.\n2\tSpeak with Dindal\tDindal the scout can be found high up in a secluded look-out, which can be reached by turning north off the east road from Imloth Melui. You should return to Dindal and let him know all that you have seen.\n",
})
